<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
